post.description:
Calendar change notification. Google echoes our channel token in
``X-Goog-Channel-Token`` and identifies the channel via ``X-Goog-Channel-ID``;
the body is empty (a "something changed" ping).

MiniAppVersionResponse.description:
One entry in an app's version history — the agent-written change summary
users review instead of raw source diffs. ``html`` is omitted from the list;
fetch a single version's detail to preview it.
